  "name": "Kill XP: Ascension dungeon-elite rate",
  "contract": [
    "Uses the live Ascension realm rates captured in PR #4128 (Rate.XP.Global 0.9295, Rate.XP.Kill 1.0909091,",
    "Rate.XP.DungeonElite 2.175) with no source-config override of those keys. The Stormwind Stockade (map 34) is",
    "level 1-60 content, so a level-20 player killing a level-20 elite there has a base gain of 145; the award",
    "truncates 145*2.175*1.0909091 = 344, then Rate.XP.Global gives 319. Stock AzerothCore awarded 290.",
    "Each attacker uses a native Deadly Bronze Poniard (3490), learned daggers, level-20 weapon skill, hit rating",
    "and expertise. Real melee damage and enemy death are prerequisites; reward assertions retain the original",
    "spell and XP expectations."
  ],
